# Release gate: keep host artifacts out of images. Without this file, COPY . .
# would bake the developer's node_modules (Windows binaries), local dist/
# output, git history, and the local .env (dev credentials) into every image.
# Double-starred directory patterns: exclusion must apply at every nesting
# level (host node_modules trees contain absolute Windows symlinks that are
# dangling inside Linux containers and break module resolution).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
.git
.env
.env.*.local
*.log
coverage/
.playwright-mcp
.opencode
.qa
*.tgz
.cache/
*.sqlite
*.db
